9. Termination and cure

Rights under this license terminate automatically upon material breach. For a
Natural Person's first unintentional breach, rights are reinstated if the
breach is fully cured within 30 days after the person discovers it or receives
written notice, whichever occurs first. There is no automatic cure for willful
misrepresentation, unauthorized Organizational use, sublicensing, sale, or
repeat breach. Sections intended by their nature to survive termination do so.

